---
/*
  The page's scrollbar (after pensatori-irrazionali.com's): a short fixed
  track at the right edge, in the middle of the screen, and a thumb that
  runs down it as the page scrolls, squared rather than rounded. In the
  layout, outside the Barba container, so it lasts across pages. Shown
  while the page scrolls, and while it is hovered or dragged; always, on
  a page that pins it (the home page).
  Styles: "Scrollbar" in style.css. Behaviour: public/js/scrollbar.js.
  Hidden from screen readers: the page scrolls as it always does.
*/
---
<div class="scrollbar" data-scrollbar data-cursor="hover" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="scrollbar__track"></div>
  <div class="scrollbar__thumb" data-scrollbar-thumb></div>
</div>
